    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Can't See!</strong>\u00a0<strong>but your senses draws the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your vision and memory due to an accident. Your guide cane became your new &quot;eye&quot;, revealing the unseen. You navigate environments that are familiar or distant\u2014 home, subway, a bustling street\u2014illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Your Cane:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each touch, your cane brings the world to life. Uncover objects that hold meaning, from a humming boombox to the scent of a flowering plant.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Memory:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect significant objects, solve tactile-based navigation puzzles, and immerse yourself in an experience designed to replicate the challenge and beauty of moving through the world without sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about exploration, adaptation, and finding warmth in the everyday. Through careful design, a rich soundscape, and intuitive mechanics, <strong>Blind Touch</strong> offers a unique perspective on discovery and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Can't See!</strong>\u00a0<strong>but your senses draws the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost your vision and memory due to an accident. Your guide cane became your new &quot;eye&quot;, revealing the unseen. You navigate environments that are familiar or distant\u2014 home, subway, a bustling street\u2014illuminating objects through touch and memory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Your Cane:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each touch, your cane brings the world to life. Uncover objects that hold meaning, from a humming boombox to the scent of a flowering plant.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/99230d3e68d2b33e52af5bace0d2c082.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Memory:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect significant objects, solve tactile-based navigation puzzles, and immerse yourself in an experience designed to replicate the challenge and beauty of moving through the world without sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/a4e5a29df77dfab29bc9ddf5cc1ce2da.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about exploration, adaptation, and finding warmth in the everyday. Through careful design, a rich soundscape, and intuitive mechanics, <strong>Blind Touch</strong> offers a unique perspective on discovery and perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.poster.avif?t=1754659430\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.webm?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521660/extras/02647f652b5ff78373d2dad2860021a0.mp4?t=1754659430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
